      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Keys and indexes lead with org_id. Foreign keys include org_id, so a row cannot point into another organisation.\nOne membership per person (an assumption): (iss, sub) is unique. If a person can belong to two organisations,\nsplit member into person (iss, sub) and membership (org_id, person_id).",
      "originalText": "Keys and indexes lead with org_id. Foreign keys include org_id, so a row cannot point into another organisation.\nOne membership per person (an assumption): (iss, sub) is unique. If a person can belong to two organisations,\nsplit member into person (iss, sub) and membership (org_id, person_id).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
